brew --version
pgbench --version
pgbench (PostgreSQL) 17.7 (Homebrew)


1. Single script contain different queries 
pgbench -f workload.sql -c 100 -j 10 -T 600 mydb

2. Multiple queries together
pgbench -f query1.sql -c 50 -T 600 mydb &
pgbench -f query2.sql -c 30 -T 600 mydb &
pgbench -f query3.sql -c 20 -T 600 mydb &
wait

3. weighted queries
pgbench -d mydb -f workload.sql -c 100 -j 10 -T 600 -M prepared

4. Replay actual production queries

pgbench -f workload.sql -M prepared -c 500 -j 50 -T 1800 mydb

